            <h2>Hi, I'm Naomika, it's nice to meet you</h2>
            <h1>I'm a designer with a passion for creating experiences!</h1>
            <section>
                <p>Originally from Singapore, I'm currently a fourth-year at UC San Diego, pursuing a 
                    <strong>B.S. in Cognitive Science with a specialization in Design and Interaction</strong>, with 
                    minors in Computer Science and Theatre. <br />I have loved both <em>theme parks</em> 
                    and <em>design</em> from a young age, and am eager to expand my horizons professionally in 
                    these spaces! I thrive in interdisciplinary environments and love creative 
                    collaboration to realise incredible ideas!</p>
            </section>
